WEBVTT

00:09:59.704 --> 00:10:04.412
I think both I was intrinsically motivated
and I was compulsive about.

00:10:05.287 --> 00:10:10.204
So I'm not sure of the distinction that
you're drawing between being compulsive

00:10:10.371 --> 00:10:13.496
and being intrinsically motivated.

00:10:14.162 --> 00:10:16.496
Well, I like to call it a look
at ambivalence there,

00:10:16.537 --> 00:10:19.954
because I think it speaks to the point
that you raised earlier, which is that,

00:10:19.954 --> 00:10:22.746
you know, positive emotions and
negative emotions can coexist.

00:10:23.037 --> 00:10:25.579
You can work because you're
passionate about it and

00:10:25.579 --> 00:10:27.954
because you feel bad if you're
not doing it. That's right.

00:10:28.246 --> 00:10:30.329
I want to ask you about the
joy of being wrong.